This namelist runs the dfmm Stage-1 verification gates (doc/dfmm_3d.md Sec. 7).
Compile using:
  cd bin && make COMPILER=METAL NDIM=3 HYDRO=1 DFMM=1 INIT=DFMMTEST

Uniform rho=1, p=1 with a divergence-free shear layer u_x = V0 sin(2 pi z / L)
and an optional initial pressure anisotropy Pi_xx = A, Pi_yy = Pi_zz = -A/2.

  Gate 2 (relaxation):    dfmm_ic_shear=0.0  dfmm_ic_pi=0.1  dfmm_tau=0.05
                          -> |Pi| must decay as exp(-t/tau)
  Gate 3 (NS limit):      dfmm_ic_shear=0.1  dfmm_ic_pi=0.0  dfmm_tau=1e-4
                          -> |Pi|/p -> 2 p tau |S0|, and |Pi-Pi_NS| -> 0
  Gate 4 (collisionless): dfmm_ic_shear=0.5  dfmm_ic_pi=0.0  dfmm_tau=-1.0
                          -> must stay realizable, min lam(P)/p > 0

&RUN_PARAMS
hydro=.true.
ncontrol=1
nrestart=0
nremap=0
nsubcycle=10*1
verbose=.false.
nstepmax=12
nsuperoct=2
/

&AMR_PARAMS
levelmin=4
levelmax=4
ngridtot=400000
ncachemax=200000
nexpand=1
boxlen=1.0
/

&INIT_PARAMS
nregion=1
region_type(1)='square'
x_center=0.5
y_center=0.5
z_center=0.5
length_x=10.0
length_y=10.0
length_z=10.0
exp_region=10.0
d_region=1.0
u_region=0.0
v_region=0.0
w_region=0.0
p_region=1.0
/

&OUTPUT_PARAMS
foutput=0
tout=0.3
/

&HYDRO_PARAMS
gamma=1.6666666666666667
courant_factor=0.8
slope_type=1
riemann='hll'
/

&DFMM_PARAMS
dfmm_tau=1e-4
dfmm_source=.true.
dfmm_diag=.true.
dfmm_ic_shear=0.1
dfmm_ic_pi=0.0
/
